Used in SEASON_SPEC.md: the requirement + WHEN/THEN scenario format, and ideas from its league
schedule, table, standings, season, simulation, awards, news, player development, player happiness
and transfer market specifications, scaled down to 8-team, 14-matchday basketball leagues. The
text in SEASON_SPEC.md is our own; no open-football code is included.
